function abilityName(id){return {fox:'Trail sprint',witch:'Arcane power',golem:'Stone shield',wisp:'Shadow step',goblin:'Healing seed',tinker:'Safe passage',ember:'Lotus blaze',frost:'Vanguard guard'}[id]||'Hero skill'}
function deathOverlay(me){if(!me.eliminated)return '';const panel=spectatorPanel(me);if(panel)return panel;let teammates=spectatorTargets(state.players,me),teamDown=(me.hearts||0)<=0&&(state.teamDefeated?.[me.team]||state.teamDefeatedUntil?.[me.team]>Date.now());return `<div class="defeat-overlay ${teammates.length?'spectating':''}" role="status"><div><span class="eyebrow">${teamDown?'TEAM DEFEATED':(me.hearts||0)>0?'ONE LIFE LOST':'THREE LIVES LOST'}</span><h2>YOU WERE DEFEATED</h2><p>Killed by ${esc(me.killedBy||'the dungeon')}</p>${me.hearts>0?`<strong data-respawn-count>RESPAWNING IN ${Math.max(0,Math.ceil((me.respawnAt-Date.now())/1000))}...</strong>`:`<strong>${teammates.length?'SPECTATING TEAMMATES':'ELIMINATED'}</strong>`}<div class="heart-display lost-heart">${'♥'.repeat(Math.max(0,me.hearts||0))}${'♡'.repeat(Math.max(0,3-(me.hearts||0)))}</div>${teammates.length?`<nav class="spectate-list" aria-label="Choose a teammate to spectate">${teammates.map(q=>`<button data-watch="${esc(q.id)}" class="${me.spectating===q.id?'selected':''}">${avatar(q,true)} ${esc(q.name)} · ${q.hp} HP</button>`).join('')}</nav>`:`<small>${teamDown?'Your whole team is out.':'No teammates remain alive.'}</small>`}<small>${me.hearts>0?'Your team keeps playing · you return safely after the countdown':'Switch between living teammates to spectate while they finish.'}</small></div></div>`}
// Document-level pointer capture survives state-driven DOM redraws during a held joystick.
let stickPointer=null,stickOrigin=null,stickDirection=null,stickLast=0;
document.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{const stick=e.target.closest('[data-joystick]');const player=state?.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me);if(!stick||stickPointer!==null||state?.phase!=='run'||!player||player.escaped||player.eliminated)return;const b=stick.getBoundingClientRect();stickPointer=e.pointerId;stickOrigin=typeof mobileRunInput==='function'&&mobileRunInput()?{x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY}:{x:b.left+b.width/2,y:b.top+b.height/2};try{stick.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)}catch{}updateStick(e);e.preventDefault()});
function stickMove(){if(state?.pvpArena?.turnBased&&state.pvpArena.participants.includes(state.me))return;const player=state?.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me),now=Date.now();if(!stickDirection||state?.phase!=='run'||!player||player.escaped||player.eliminated||player.stunnedUntil>now||player.knockbackUntil>now||state.announcement?.until>now||document.querySelector('.audio-settings-dialog[open]'))return;const step=heroStats(player).move,gap=player.slowUntil>now?Math.max(420,step*2)+5:player.speedUntil>now?Math.round(step*.65)+5:step+5;if(now-stickLast<gap||queuedActions>=2)return;stickLast=now;send({type:'move',dir:stickDirection})}
function updateStick(e){const player=state?.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me);if(e.pointerId!==stickPointer||!stickOrigin)return;if(!player||player.escaped||player.eliminated){releaseStick();return}const x=e.clientX-stickOrigin.x,y=e.clientY-stickOrigin.y;const mobile=typeof mobileRunInput==='function'&&mobileRunInput(),distanceFromCenter=Math.hypot(x,y),horizontal=Math.abs(x)>Math.abs(y);if(distanceFromCenter<(mobile?5:6))stickDirection=null;else if(!mobile||!stickDirection||Math.abs(Math.abs(x)-Math.abs(y))>distanceFromCenter*.18)stickDirection=mazeScreenDirection(horizontal?[Math.sign(x),0]:[0,Math.sign(y)]);const knob=document.querySelector('[data-joystick] i'),distance=Math.hypot(x,y)||1,scale=Math.min(1,27/distance);if(knob)knob.style.transform=`translate(${x*scale}px,${y*scale}px)`;stickMove()}
document.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{const button=e.target.closest('[data-move]');if(typeof mobileRunInput!=='function'||!mobileRunInput()||!button||stickPointer!==null||button.disabled)return;stickPointer=e.pointerId;stickOrigin=null;stickDirection=mazeScreenDirection(DIRECTIONS[+button.dataset.move]);stickLast=0;try{button.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)}catch{}stickMove();e.preventDefault()});
document.addEventListener('pointermove',updateStick);function releaseStick(e){if(e?.pointerId!==undefined&&e.pointerId!==stickPointer)return;stickPointer=null;stickOrigin=null;stickDirection=null;const knob=document.querySelector('[data-joystick] i');if(knob)knob.style.transform=''}
setInterval(stickMove,25);
document.addEventListener('pointerup',releaseStick);document.addEventListener('pointercancel',releaseStick);window.addEventListener('blur',releaseStick);setViewportUnit();let viewportFrame=0;const refreshViewport=()=>{cancelAnimationFrame(viewportFrame);viewportFrame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{setViewportUnit();syncDeviceLayout();releaseStick();queueInteriorCamera();const me=state?.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me),focus=spectateFocus(me),maze=document.querySelector('.maze-live[style*="--cam-zoom"]');if(maze&&focus){const style=runCamera(focus,state.mazeSize||7,state.floor);for(const rule of style.split(';').filter(Boolean)){const [name,value]=rule.split(':');maze.style.setProperty(name,value)}}})};window.addEventListener('resize',refreshViewport,{passive:true});window.addEventListener('orientationchange',refreshViewport,{passive:true});window.visualViewport?.addEventListener('resize',refreshViewport,{passive:true});document.addEventListener('fullscreenchange',refreshViewport);
setInterval(()=>{const me=state?.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me);const count=document.querySelector('[data-respawn-count]');if(count&&me?.respawnAt)count.textContent='RESPAWNING IN '+Math.max(0,Math.ceil((me.respawnAt-Date.now())/1000))+'...';if(state?.pvpArena){document.querySelectorAll('[data-realm-count]').forEach(label=>label.textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((state.pvpArena.until-Date.now())/1000))+'s');document.querySelectorAll('[data-realm-deadline]').forEach(label=>{label.textContent=formatRealmTime(state.pvpArena.until);label.closest('.realm-deadline')?.classList.toggle('is-urgent',state.pvpArena.until-Date.now()<=5000)})}const ability=document.querySelector('[data-ability]');if(ability&&me){let left=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(((me.lastAbility||0)+heroStats(me).ability-Date.now())/1000));ability.disabled=me.eliminated||me.escaped||me.stunnedUntil>Date.now()||left>0;ability.querySelector('span').textContent=left?'Ready in '+left+'s':abilityName(me.character)+' · +50% next hit'}},100);
setInterval(()=>{if(state?.phase!=='run')return;const me=state.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me);if(!me)return;const weapon=weaponStats(me),cooldown=weapon.cooldown||450,readyAt=Math.max(localShotReady,attackReadyAt(me)),left=Math.max(0,readyAt-Date.now()),percent=Math.min(100,left/cooldown*100),fill=document.querySelector('[data-reload-fill]'),meter=fill?.parentElement,label=document.querySelector('#weaponReady'),attack=document.querySelector('[data-fp-attack]');if(fill)fill.style.width=(100-percent)+'%';if(meter)meter.setAttribute('aria-valuenow',String(Math.round(100-percent)));if(label&&(Date.now()>=combatMessageUntil||!combatMessageUntil)){label.classList.remove('combat-feedback');label.textContent=me.escaped?'ESCAPED · Waiting for the round':me.eliminated?'SPECTATING · Match continues':attackReadyText();if(Date.now()>=combatMessageUntil){combatMessage='';combatMessageUntil=0}}if(attack)attack.disabled=me.escaped||me.eliminated||state.announcement?.until>Date.now()||attackTargets(me,1-me.team).length===0&&me.character!=='wisp'&&!(inRealm(me)&&state.floor<=3)},100);
setInterval(()=>{if(state?.phase!=='run'||state.floor!==1)return;const me=state.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me);if(!me||!inRealm(me))return;const now=Date.now(),weapon=weaponStats(me),items={attack:[Math.max(localShotReady,attackReadyAt(me))-now,weapon.cooldown],ability:[(me.lastAbility||0)+heroStats(me).ability-now,heroStats(me).ability],dodge:[(me.lastDodge||0)+heroStats(me).dodge-now,heroStats(me).dodge]};for(const [key,[raw,total]] of Object.entries(items)){const ring=app.querySelector(`[data-duel-ring="${key}"]`);if(!ring)continue;const left=Math.max(0,raw);ring.style.setProperty('--remaining',`${Math.min(100,left/total*100)}%`);ring.querySelector('[data-duel-seconds]').textContent=left?(left/1000).toFixed(1)+'s':'READY';ring.classList.toggle('is-ready',!left)}},100);
setInterval(()=>{if(state?.phase!=='run')return;const scene=app.querySelector('.run-board');scene?.classList.toggle('is-hurt',Date.now()<hurtUntil);const event=state.combatEvents?.filter(e=>e.attacker===state.me&&Date.now()-e.at<1000).at(-1);let feedback=scene?.querySelector('.hit-feedback');if(event&&!feedback){feedback=document.createElement('div');feedback.className='hit-feedback';scene?.append(feedback)}if(feedback){if(event)feedback.textContent=`HIT · −${event.damage} HP`;else feedback.remove()}},100);
function removeBrokenChatBubbles(){app.querySelectorAll('.combat-log,.chat-bubble,[data-chat-bubble],.run-chat-bubble').forEach(node=>node.remove())}
removeBrokenChatBubbles();

// The results timer reads the existing server deadline; it never advances the floor.
setInterval(()=>{const node=document.querySelector('.result-next[data-result-until]');if(!node)return;const until=Number(node.dataset.resultUntil);if(!until)return;const remaining=Math.max(0,until-Date.now());const seconds=node.querySelector('[data-result-seconds]');const bar=node.querySelector('[data-result-progress]');if(seconds)seconds.textContent=String(Math.ceil(remaining/1000));if(bar)bar.style.width=(remaining/6500*100).toFixed(1)+'%'},150);

setInterval(()=>{const a=state?.pvpArena;if(!a?.turnBased)return;for(const el of document.querySelectorAll('[data-turn-count]'))el.textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((a.turnUntil-Date.now())/1000));},100);

setInterval(()=>{if(state?.phase!=='run')return;for(const fx of app.querySelectorAll('[data-expires-at]'))if(Number(fx.dataset.expiresAt)<=Date.now())fx.remove()},100);

let attackHoldTimer=0,attackHoldScene='';
function stopAttackHold(){clearInterval(attackHoldTimer);attackHoldTimer=0;}
function wireAttackHold(){const button=app.querySelector('[data-fp-attack]');if(!button)return;button.onpointerdown=e=>{if(e.button!==0||button.disabled)return;e.preventDefault();stopAttackHold();button.setPointerCapture?.(e.pointerId);const me=state.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me);attackHoldScene=combatScene(state,me);const strike=()=>{const p=state?.players.find(p=>p.id===state.me);if(!p||combatScene(state,p)!==attackHoldScene||document.hidden){stopAttackHold();return;}if(queuedActions<2)attackAhead(p,p.team)};strike();attackHoldTimer=setInterval(strike,80)};button.onpointerup=stopAttackHold;button.onpointercancel=stopAttackHold;button.onlostpointercapture=stopAttackHold;}
window.addEventListener('pointerup',stopAttackHold);window.addEventListener('blur',stopAttackHold);document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden)stopAttackHold()});
function refreshActorState(){if(state?.phase!=='run')return;const now=Date.now();for(const hero of app.querySelectorAll('.combat-hero[data-player-id]')){const p=state.players.find(p=>p.id===hero.dataset.playerId);if(!p)continue;const flags={'hero-attacking':now-(p.lastShot||0)<650,'hero-ability':now-Math.max(p.duelAbilityAt||0,p.lastAbility||0)<700,'hero-moving':p.runUntil>now,'hero-stunned':p.stunnedUntil>now,'hero-hit':p.hitUntil>now,'hero-dodging':now-(p.duelDodgeAt||p.lastDodge||0)<650,'hero-defending':now-(p.duelDefendAt||0)<650,'hero-knocked':now-(p.knockback?.at||0)<850};for(const [name,active]of Object.entries(flags))hero.classList.toggle(name,!!active)}for(const hp of app.querySelectorAll('[data-health-hit]')){const p=state.players.find(p=>hp.dataset.uiKey===`health-${p.id}-${p.damageSeq||0}`);if(p)hp.classList.toggle('hp-hit',p.hitUntil>now)}}
setInterval(refreshActorState,100);

setInterval(()=>{if(state?.phase==='run')trimEdgeActors()},200);
